<summary class="card-header bg-light text-danger font-weight-bold">
Does Zefoy have official resellers?
</summary>
<div class="card-body">
<p class="mb-0">
No. Zefoy does not have official resellers, sellers, agents, partners,
payment representatives, or third-party service providers.
</p>
</div>
</details>

<details class="card border-danger mb-2">
<summary class="card-header bg-light text-danger font-weight-bold">
What signs show that a Zefoy website may be fake?
</summary>
<div class="card-body">
<p class="mb-0">
A Zefoy website may be fake if it uses a different domain, asks for payment,
offers APK downloads, claims to be an official app, promotes private groups,
copies the Zefoy name, or asks for personal information.
</p>
</div>
</details>

<details class="card border-danger mb-2">
<summary class="card-header bg-light text-danger font-weight-bold">
Is Zefoy available only through a website?
</summary>
<div class="card-body">
<p class="mb-0">
Yes. The Zefoy service is available only through the official website <strong>https://zefoy.com/</strong>.
There is no official mobile app, desktop app, browser extension, APK file, or downloadable software.
</p>
</div>
</details>

<details class="card border-danger mb-2">
<summary class="card-header bg-light text-danger font-weight-bold">
Can I trust Zefoy results from search engines?
</summary>
<div class="card-body">
<p class="mb-0">
Users should verify every search result carefully. A search result is only official if it opens
<strong>https://zefoy.com/</strong>. Similar names, copied titles, or copied descriptions do not make a website official.
</p>
</div>
</details>

<details class="card border-danger mb-2">
<summary class="card-header bg-light text-danger font-weight-bold">
Does Zefoy require login on third-party websites?
</summary>
<div class="card-body">
<p class="mb-0">
No. Zefoy does not ask users to log in through third-party websites, unofficial pages,
fake support pages, app listings, APK websites, or external panels using the Zefoy name.
</p>
</div>
</details>

<details class="card border-danger mb-2">
<summary class="card-header bg-light text-danger font-weight-bold">
Are Zefoy premium or VIP pages official?
</summary>
<div class="card-body">
<p class="mb-0">
No. Zefoy does not offer official premium pages, VIP access, paid access, private tools,
unlock packages, subscriptions, reseller packages, or paid support pages.
</p>
</div>
</details>

<details class="card border-danger mb-2">
<summary class="card-header bg-light text-danger font-weight-bold">
Why should I check the Zefoy domain carefully?
</summary>
<div class="card-body">
<p class="mb-0">
Fake websites may use similar spelling, copied layouts, fake app names, misleading descriptions,
or unofficial domains to confuse users. Always confirm that the address is <strong>https://zefoy.com/</strong>.
</p>
</div>
</details>

<details class="card border-danger mb-0">
<summary class="card-header bg-light text-danger font-weight-bold">
Is a copied Zefoy design proof that a website is official?
</summary>
<div class="card-body">
<p class="mb-0">
No. Fake websites may copy layouts, colors, icons, text, warnings, buttons, and titles.
The only proof is the official domain: <strong>https://zefoy.com/</strong>.
</p>
</div>
</details>

